    {
      "claim": "After successful storage upload, an empty matchedImageIds is ambiguous, not proof of no face match: SearchAsync returns [] when SearchPhotosByFaceUrl is missing, comparison photos are absent, HTTP is non-success, or response IDs are absent/unusable; a successful search may also return no matches. On this path the handler sets FaceId=\"false\", stores the upload key and selfie history, adds no UserProductImages or UserSelfieFaceIds for this request, and returns success=1/count=0. These are source-reviewed conclusions; Atlas does not infer this control flow.",
